222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 61 0 R
/T (Women described suspected dealing, intimidation and concern about young people becoming involved. Their accounts should not be treated as evidence of the scale of drug dealing, but neither should repeated community concerns simply be dismissed. There needs to be better communication between residents, police, safeguarding services, Public Health and trusted community organisations so people understand where concerns can be reported and what happens after they are raised.)
/E (Women described suspected dealing, intimidation and concern about young people becoming involved. Their accounts should not be treated as evidence of the scale of drug dealing, but neither should repeated community concerns simply be dismissed. There needs to be better communication between residents, police, safeguarding services, Public Health and trusted community organisations so people understand where concerns can be reported and what happens after they are raised.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
