876 0 obj
<<
/Title (Perhaps the clearest lesson from the focus group was that women were willing to talk about addiction when given an appropriate space to do so. Similar conversations should continue with women, men, young people, parents and people directly affected by addiction. These discussions can help services understand experiences that may otherwise remain hidden and ensure future support is shaped with communities rather than designed for them from a distance.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 766 0 R
/Next 877 0 R
>>
